        "created_at": "2015-02-08T23:44:45.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>So I just bought the Sentinels Tactics Uprising Expansion and while I was looking through the power cards, I noticed that I have multiples of a few of them. According to the back of the box I should have 51 cards, and I do... I'm just not sure if they are the right ones. If anyone has the correct card list for this set so I can check what I have against it, I would be eternally grateful.&nbsp;</p>",
